{"municipality_code":"42308","pref":"長崎県","city":"時津町","headline":"公園・遊具や史跡・遺跡が、この街を歩く手がかりになりそうです。","display_comment_enriched":"時津町には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 まずは社寺・石碑・案内板に目を向けると、地域の由緒をたどる手がかりが見つけやすいでしょう。 現地では石碑、地蔵、地域資料館、公民館の由緒板を既存ピンと照らし合わせながら歩くと、見落としがちな地域の物語に出会いやすくなります。 「打坂地蔵尊」や「さばくさらかし岩（継石坊主）」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":75,"rank":722,"percentile":61.7,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":23,"rank":655,"percentile":64.9,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":14,"rank":1457,"percentile":20.9,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":4,"rank":1499,"percentile":15.1,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":2,"rank":1236,"percentile":23.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":1,"rank":1563,"percentile":14.5,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":[],"tourism_landmarks":["打坂地蔵尊","さばくさらかし岩（継石坊主）","日本二十六聖人上陸の碑","崎野ノ鼻・崎野自然公園"],"food_culture":["皿うどん（